Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 16:20:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH openEuler-26.09 15/22] mm: make architecture i_mmap cache walkers
 shard-aware

hulk inclusion
category: feature
bugzilla: https://atomgit.com/openeuler/kernel/issues/9771

--------------------------------

Several aliasing-cache implementations walk mapping->i_mmap while holding
the IRQ-safe dcache mapping lock. Replacing that lock with sleeping shard
rwsems would be invalid, while retaining the central root would miss VMAs.

Serialize shard installation with flush_dcache_mmap_lock() and add an
iterator for callers that already hold that lock. Convert the ARM, Nios II,
and PA-RISC cache-maintenance walkers to visit every published root without
sleeping in their IRQ-safe sections.

Signed-off-by: Dong Chenchen <dongchenchen2@huawei.com>
---
